🧠 The Main Idea to Remember

The most important logic in this project is:

unique = []

for num in numbers:
    if num not in unique:
        unique.append(num)

Remember it as:

"Check → If new → Add."

Number comes
     ↓
Already inside?
   ↙       ↘
 YES       NO
  ↓         ↓
Skip       Add

And the shortcut is:

set(numbers)



List = keeps everything

🍎 🍎 🍌 🍌 🍊

Set = keeps one of each

🍎 🍌 🍊


